OL,3,GNEWSAWonky wych elm in County Down
OL,4,Acrowned Tree of the Year
OL,5,
OL,6,FNewcastle's 'Bendy Tree' has been
OL,7,Fcrowned UK Tree of the Year 2026 - the
OL,8,Ffirst time a tree in Northern Ireland
OL,9,Fhas won the national title since it was
OL,10,Flaunched in 2014.
OL,12,FThe 150-year-old wych elm on the
OL,13,Fcentral promenade took more than 30% of
OL,14,Fthe national public vote.
OL,16,FThe theme of the Woodland Trust's
OL,17,Fannual competition was Against All
OL,18,FOdds, with trees across the UK
OL,19,Fshortlisted for being impressive,
OL,20,Fbeautiful and sometimes baffling
OL,21,Fexamples of how nature can survive
OL,22,Fadversity.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
