OL,3,GNEWSAWonky wych elm in County Down
OL,4,Acrowned Tree of the Year
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland director John Martin
OL,7,Fsaid he was rooting for the "whimsical"
OL,8,Ftree to win and said tens of thousands
OL,9,Facross the UK had clearly felt the
OL,10,Fsame.
